          ],
          "dosage": "Internal use: decoction 3–9 grams; or used in pills and powders. External use: grind to powder for topical application, decoct for gargling or washing.",
          "preparation_method": "Remove impurities, briefly soak and wash clean, moisten thoroughly, slice, and sun-dry; processing may include singeing or striking out fibrous roots.",
